      "review_description": "Great experience with Green Energy Solutions who provided great service and advice, quality products and A1 install.I had done a bit of research but was about to give up on solar after getting quotes and very different advice from other companies when I was referred to Mike who listened and gave no fuss advice on system design.I raised the option of increasing the system size or including expensive extras (timers, monitoring, etc) as recommended by other companies and he talked through the pros and cons before steering me away from them for $ and functionality reasons. He could easily have cashed in by taking advantage and it speaks volumes that he didn't.His young installers were polite, professional, cleaned up after themselves (!) and dealt with any installation challenges quickly and efficiently. From quotation to operational in 5 working days!",
